00:57:25.800 --> 00:57:31.120
<v Faron Yoder>I went and got rid of my Amish haircut, went and got rid of my Amish clothes.
<v Faron Yoder>我去剪掉了我的阿米什发型，扔掉了我的阿米什衣服。

00:57:31.120 --> 00:57:56.920
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

